WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:04.984
Think of a landline with
speed dial, but with video.

2
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.600
She presses one big
physical button,

3
00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:12.319
and it immediately starts
a video call.

4
00:00:13.557 --> 00:00:15.350
And when her siblings call her,

5
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.769
HelloPorch answers automatically.

6
00:00:23.227 --> 00:00:25.350
There's no phone to find,

7
00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:27.320
no screen to unlock,

8
00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:29.864
no app to remember.
